# Analysis

The baseline CNN from Week 2 showed overfitting because training accuracy became much higher than validation accuracy.

After adding:

* transfer learning,
* augmentation,
* dropout,

the validation accuracy improved significantly and the training became more stable.

The pretrained MobileNetV2 model extracted more meaningful visual features compared to the manually built CNN.

